      "source_context": "Do not use fresh manure as it may contain harmful bacteria and may increase weed problems. In mid-summer, side-dress with a balanced fertilizer such as 10-10- 10 at a rate of one cup per 10 feet of row. Spread the fertilizer alongside the row, about six inches away from the plants, and scratch it into the soil.",
